        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s218",
          "text": "When a Daycare Fails to Protect Your Child, We Help Families Seek Justice",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b21b",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s21a",
          "text": "Leaving your child at daycare requires an enormous amount of trust. Parents expect licensed childcare providers to create a safe environment, supervise children appropriately, and respond quickly when accidents or emergencies occur. When that trust is broken because of negligence or abuse, the consequences can be devastating.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b21d",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s21c",
          "text": "If your child has suffered an injury at a daycare, preschool, or childcare center, our attorneys can help you understand your legal options. We represent families throughout Colorado whose children have been harmed due to negligent supervision, unsafe conditions, abuse, or other preventable incidents.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b21f",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s21e",
          "text": "Our goal is simple: hold negligent daycare providers accountable while helping families recover the compensation they need to move forward.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b21i",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s21h",
          "text": "Common Causes of Daycare Injuries",
